:null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-02-06T20:46:46Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T21:21:57Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in Godot 4.6 release.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 - Vulkan (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI found two undesirable behaviors when using pivot offset ratio. The first applies to all control nodes that I've tested, and the second applies to labels specifically:\n1. When dragging the bounding box of a control that has been rotated and had its pivot changed by pivot ratio, it will scale incorrectly.\n2. When adding text to a label that has been rotated and had its pivot changed by pivot ratio, such that the size of the label would increase, the label will slowly move in an incorrect direction.\n\nImportantly, these bugs aren't present when using pivot offset.\n\nHere's a recording of both issues:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/699f1b1c-9a0e-40e0-8bd4-00183affc5b5\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new Label node (or other Control).\n2. Change its pivot offset ratio.\n3. Rotate it by some amount.\n4. Attempt to drag the handles of its bounding box (or add text to the label, such that the label would need to increase in size).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115977/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115977/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}